WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.880
¿Has probado algo de esto?

00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:03.840
Miss Gina Rose.

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:07.000
Why would I need

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:07.840
to know this?

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:08.680
You need to learn it,

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:10.600
to convince everyone

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.320
we're a real couple.

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:16.080
There's a lot of info, Curly Pie.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:17.560
You need to go through

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:18.760
it all thoroughly.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:19.840
I arranged with

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:21.160
the hospital staff, so...

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:22.760
 my assistant

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:24.520
will distribute gifts instead

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:25.440
of you and...

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:28.280
your partner.

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:29.720
Thank you.

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:30.680
What?

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:32.200
Are you kidding?

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:33.720
No way I'm letting

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:35.640
an assistant have all the fun.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:37.320
We'll do it ourselves.

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:39.400
Me and you.

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:40.600
Him?

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:44.160
Don't even think about it.

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:45.440
It's the best way to get

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:46.360
to know each other.
